B.bA1=new A.mN("Do Not Consume Unjustly","And do not consume one another\u2019s wealth unjustly, nor use it to bribe judges (2:188). Even when the trade is by mutual consent, the unjust line can still be crossed \u2014 the verse names the temptation before it happens.",u.gy)
B.bA0=new A.mN("The Birds Leave Hungry","The Prophet \ufdfa said: if you relied upon Allah as He should be relied upon, He would provide you as He provides the birds \u2014 they leave hungry in the morning and return full (Tirmidhi 2344, hasan per Darussalam). Rizq is not chased; it is met.",u.y)
B.bA6=new A.mN("The Honest Measure","Woe to the defrauders \u2014 those who take full measure when they receive, but give less when they measure for others (83:1-3). The Prophet \ufdfa passed by a heap of food, put his hand in it, and found it wet underneath \u2014 the seller had watered the top. He said: the one who cheats is not one of us (Muslim 102).",u.eR)
B.bzZ=new A.mN("Honest Work Over Easy Wealth","The Prophet \ufdfa said: Allah loves a servant who is pious, independent, and hidden (Muslim 2965). And the honest laborer is better than the one who begs persistently \u2014 the hand that works is raised in dua, the hand that only receives is lowered.",u.bC)
B.aCk=s([B.bA1,B.bA0,B.bA6,B.bzZ],t.W0)
B.bA9=new A.Kc("Halal Earnings","The halal dirham is not just legal \u2014 it is blessed. The barakah is in the honesty, not the amount.",B.aCk)
B.bzY=new A.mN("What Riba Actually Is","Riba is stipulated increase on a loan \u2014 interest, usury. Allah permitted trade and forbidden riba (2:275). The lender is not an investor; a loan is a trust, not a product. The distinction matters more as every app offers 'buy now, pay later.'","Check one of your financial products this week: is any charge stipulated on the loan itself? Ask a scholar about it.")
B.bA3=new A.mN("The Riba Economy","Riba consumes wealth the way fire consumes what it touches (2:275). The global economy runs on it \u2014 which does not make it halal; it makes escape a discipline. Start small: one riba-based habit exited this year is a jihad.","Name one riba-adjacent habit (a card balance carried, a BNPL plan). Set an exit date \u2014 even a year away \u2014 and write it down.")
B.bA5=new A.mN("Leaving Riba With Dignity","If you are in riba and fear poverty, Allah promises that leaving it opens the door of relief (2:280). The exit is not a loss; it is a declaration of which side of the war you are on. Scholars can help structure the transition \u2014 you are not the first to leave.",u.bZ)
B.aGv=s([B.bzY,B.bA3,B.bA5],t.W0)
B.bA7=new A.Kc("Riba \u2014 The War You Declared","Allah declares war on the riba-taker (2:278-279). No other sin gets this word.",B.aGv)
B.bA2=new A.mN("Zakat on Savings","Zakat is due on zakatable wealth \u2014 cash, gold, trade goods \u2014 held above the nisab (85 grams of gold) for one lunar year, at 2.5% (see the huda-zakat guide). The recipients are named in one verse (9:60): the poor, the needy, the administrators, those whose hearts are to be reconciled, freeing captives, the debt-ridden, in Allah\u2019s cause, and the stranded traveler.",u.fq)
B.bA4=new A.mN("Debt and the Door","The Prophet \ufdfa said: whoever takes people\u2019s wealth intending to repay it, Allah will repay it for them (Bukhari 2387). Debt is a weight \u2014 but the weight has a door, and the door is intention plus effort.",u.ga)
B.bA_=new A.mN("The Cure for Burnout Is Barakah","The anxious professional checks everything twice and sleeps poorly; the believer works the same hours and sleeps differently. Not because the work is lighter \u2014 but because the rizq is Someone else\u2019s to give. The sabbath of the soul is prayer in the middle of the hustle.",u.g3)
B.aq8=s([B.bA2,B.bA4,B.bA_],t.W0)
B.bA8=new A.Kc("Zakat in Practice & Wealth That Purifies","The third pillar in the modern wallet: savings, investments, retirement accounts.",B.aq8)
B.as4=s([B.bA9,B.bA7,B.bA8],A.aa("y<Kc>"))
