B.bxc=new A.uB("The Obligation","O you who believe, fasting is prescribed for you as it was prescribed for those before you, that you may attain taqwa (2:183). The month of Ramadan in which the Quran was revealed (2:185). Two verses, one month, one purpose: a training in God-consciousness.")
B.bxf=new A.uB("Who Fasts, Who Is Excused","The sick and the traveler may break the fast and make it up later (2:184) \u2014 and Allah intends for you ease and does not intend for you hardship (2:185). The exemption is the ruling itself showing mercy; using it is not a loophole.")
